From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rui Figueira <rfigueira@cloudflare.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 00:28:21 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Mark semantic parts in painted scenes

Name backgrounds, borders, markers, decorations, and form controls so
non-pixel consumers do not have to infer their purpose from geometry.
Keep decoration markers tied to their owning node and reuse the
existing form-control painter so raster output stays unchanged.
---
 src/render.rs               | 15 ++++++++++++++-
 src/render/form_controls.rs |  6 +++++-
 src/text.rs                 |  6 ++++++
 3 files changed, 25 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/render.rs b/src/render.rs
index 5a66cc6..69fcbef 100644
--- a/src/render.rs
+++ b/src/render.rs
